---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'May 11, 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  metaTitle="Terms of Service - Calculations.tools"
  description="Terms of service for calculations.tools. Free to use, no account required. Read our usage terms, disclaimer of warranties, and limitation of liability."
  canonical="https://calculations.tools/terms-of-service"
>
  <div class="au-page">
    <div class="au-container">

      <header class="au-hero" style="text-align:left; padding-bottom:2rem; margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
        <p class="au-eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="au-headline" style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.4rem); text-align:left;">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p style="font-size:0.82rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35); margin-top:0.5rem;">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="tos-body">

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Acceptance of terms</h2>
          <p>By accessing or using calculations.tools ("the site"), you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree, please stop using the site.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Use of the site</h2>
          <p>Calculations.tools provides free online calculators and converters for personal, educational, and informational use. You may use the site for any lawful purpose. You may not:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, scrape en masse, or interfere with the operation of the site</li>
            <li>Use the site in a way that damages, disables, or impairs its availability for others</li>
            <li>Represent that any result from this site constitutes professional financial, medical, legal, or tax advice</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>No professional advice</h2>
          <p>All calculators and converters on this site provide general informational results only. Nothing on calculations.tools constitutes financial, investment, medical, legal, or tax advice. Results should not be relied upon as a substitute for consultation with a qualified professional.</p>
          <p>For health calculations (BMI, body fat, ideal weight, etc.), formulas are sourced from peer-reviewed references. They are not diagnostic tools and do not replace medical evaluation.</p>
          <p>For finance calculations (compound interest, loan payments, ROI, etc.), results are illustrative estimates and do not account for your individual circumstances, taxes, fees, or market conditions.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Accuracy of results</h2>
          <p>We make every effort to ensure the formulas and results on this site are accurate. All formulas are verified against primary reference sources prior to publication - see our <a href="/editorial-standards">editorial standards</a> for details.</p>
          <p>However, we cannot guarantee that all results are error-free. You are responsible for independently verifying any result before acting on it. If you believe a formula or result is incorrect, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@calculations.tools">info@calculations.tools</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>The content, design, code, and branding of calculations.tools are owned by the company itself unless otherwise noted. You may not reproduce or redistribute site content for commercial purposes without prior written permission.</p>
          <p>Individual formulas and mathematical methods are in the public domain and may be used freely.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Embed tools</h2>
          <p>We offer free embed widgets for select tools. When embedding a tool on your website, you must retain the "Powered by calculations.tools" attribution link. Removing or obscuring attribution is not permitted.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Privacy</h2>
          <p>All calculations run locally in your browser. No input data is sent to our servers. For details on data collection (analytics, cookies), see our <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
          <p>The site is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that the site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of harmful components.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, calculations.tools and its owner shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of, or inability to use, the site or its results - even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Third-party links</h2>
          <p>The site may contain links to third-party websites for reference purposes. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of any linked site.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top of this page indicates when the terms were last revised. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Governing law</h2>
          <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Denmark. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Denmark.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="tos-section">
          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about these terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:info@calculations.tools">info@calculations.tools</a>.</p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .tos-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  .tos-section {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .tos-section h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .tos-section p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }
  .tos-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .tos-section ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.65rem;
  }
  .tos-section ul li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .tos-section a {
    color: #a78bfa;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tos-section a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .au-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 3rem 1rem 5rem;
  }
  .au-container {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .au-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .au-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: white;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .au-subline {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
  }
</style>
